<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_lang_proc">LangProc</link></para>

<para>This class handles the language processing for the <link linkend="_namespace_bearsampp">Bearsampp</link> application. It loads language files, retrieves language settings, and provides language-specific values. </para>
